# 跨平台换行/编码统一（Windows 开发，CI/Linux 运行）
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary

# SQL/迁移/脚本强制 LF（runner 与 CI 依赖）
*.sql text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
